          "Build specific rural governance expertise: water rights, agricultural infrastructure, rural hospital viability, and the cost of service delivery in low-density areas are the practical governance issues that matter to working-class households in this district, and demonstrating fluency on these issues distinguishes a legislator from one who delegates rural concerns to abstract policy."
