          "Lead on working-class economic security: at $51,457 median income with only 15.8% college education, this is a district of households living paycheck-to-paycheck where utility costs, healthcare, property taxes, and childcare affordability are the primary concerns—not abstract conservative messaging.",
          "Establish visible constituent service infrastructure and regular town halls or listening sessions; an unopposed incumbent risks appearing disconnected from the district. Active presence and demonstrated responsiveness to specific concerns are the political insurance against an opponent who runs on accessibility and attentiveness."
