          "Lead with working-class household economic security: property tax burden, rural healthcare access, infrastructure maintenance, and utility costs are the material concerns of a 59.4% white constituency at $44,064 income with 59.4% homeownership. These are not abstract policy positions but direct family budget pressures.",
