          "Lead on older homeowner economic security: at $62,354 income with a 41.2-year median age in a 62.4% homeowner district, healthcare costs, property tax fairness, and rural service viability are the material concerns that will either consolidate or erode Republican margins if a challenger emerges. Specific policy answers on these issues are the foundation of durable electoral strength."
