          "Lead with the material economic concerns of a $47,169 median income, 52.7% renter constituency: housing stability, childcare costs, healthcare access, and wage growth are the household-level issues that 100% margins can obscure if a representative defaults to party messaging rather than constituent-specific problem-solving.",
