          "Demonstrate measurable school improvement: a 16.6% college-attainment district depends entirely on K-12 schools as the economic mobility engine — concrete resource allocation to schools, teacher compensation, and college-readiness programs are non-negotiable visibility markers for constituent investment.",
          "Guard against incumbent complacency: unopposed status creates organizational risk, not security — maintain authentic town hall presence, conduct regular constituent surveys on material needs, and use opposition research to identify potential primary challengers before they gain traction."
