          "Do not assume 89% removes the obligation to remain actively constituent-responsive: treating the seat as safe enough to govern remotely or to prioritize downtown or donor interests over working-class constituent needs is the exact failure mode that can turn a 89% result into a 60% result when electoral competition re-emerges."
