          "Build active relationships with the Black and Native American communities represented in the ~4.7% demographic gap — engage community leaders, attend civic institutions, and develop specific legislative positions on education, economic opportunity, and healthcare access rather than assuming these voters will remain invisible.",
          "Develop a constituent service operation that demonstrates responsive governance across all communities in the district — the uncontested 2022 result provides no baseline for turnout or support among the unaccounted-for 4.7%, and a future challenger who builds grassroots infrastructure in those communities could shift the margin significantly."
