          "Deliver measurable healthcare access improvement: the 23.9% college attainment and working-class income profile signal limited health insurance access and pharmacy cost burden; a representative's capacity to secure Medicaid expansion, reduce prescription drug costs, and improve clinic access in the district is the most concrete way to demonstrate governance competence.",
